  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejoramiento Urbano Rio de Janeiro II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Improvement Rio de Janeiro II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE IS TO IMPROVE THE LIVING CONDITIONS OF THE LOW-INCOME RESIDENTS OF RIO&apos;S FAVELAS AND IRREGULAR SUBDIVISIONS. CONSISTS OF THE SECOND STAGE OF THE PROGRAM BR-0182, IN EXECUTIONS SINCE 1995. THIS STAGE WOULD BENEFIT ADDITIONAL 70 FAVELAS AND SETTLEMENTS, AND WOULD INCLUDE INTEGRATED NEIGHBORHOOD UPGRADING AND TECHNICAL ASISTANCE COMPONENTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
